<title>UK: Mowlem swings to 96 profit. [CORRECTED 09:03 GMT]</title>
<headline>Mowlem swings to 96 profit. [CORRECTED 09:03 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>				(million stg unless stated)</p>
